  "story": {
    "text": "Everyone is ready for an {EXCURSION} to Whitwell, but at {BREAKFAST} Colonel Brandon gets a {LETTER}, and rides off to London {URGENTLY}, saying nothing. The day is {SPOILED}. So Willoughby drives Marianne, {ALONE}, to see Allenham, the house he will inherit from his {AUNT}.",
